<title>ESTONIA: NORMA CUM-DIVIDEND TRADING TO END.</title>
<headline>NORMA CUM-DIVIDEND TRADING TO END.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cum-dividend trading in Norma shares is to end today, the stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>All trade in Norma from Tuesday May 6 will be ex-dividend trading, the stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Norma's management proposed on April 19 that a dividend of one kroon per share will be paid.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
